  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and saute until they are translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the chopped red bell pepper and saute for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable stock cubes, water, and dried thyme to the pot, stirring to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots, potatoes, and zucchini to the pot, stirring to combine.",
    "Continue to simmer the stew for an additional 20 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and scotch bonnet peppers, if using.",
    "Season the stew with salt and pepper to taste, then serve hot."
  ],
